---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Web Design Prices & Local SEO Packages | Pixova Birmingham"
  description="Web design prices and local SEO packages for small businesses from £49/month. No upfront cost. No long contracts. Based in Birmingham."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.pixova.uk/pricing/"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative pt-20 pb-16 overflow-hidden" style="background:#0D2240; min-height:320px;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:url('/images/hero-laptop.webp'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; opacity:0.10;"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(13,34,64,0.97) 0%, rgba(28,53,87,0.88) 60%, rgba(13,34,64,0.97) 100%);"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:#2ECC9A;">PRICING</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-semibold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-3 mb-5" style="color:#fff;">
        Web design prices and local SEO packages for small businesses.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);">
        Most small businesses arrive here with the same question: what does it actually cost, and will it be worth it? Monthly plans start at £49. I offer affordable SEO and website design for small businesses across the UK, with nothing to pay upfront. I build your site first. You start paying once it's live. Based in Birmingham, I'll always give you a clear quote before anything starts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 1: Monthly plans -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:#2ECC9A;">MONTHLY PLANS</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-3xl mt-3 mb-3" style="color:#1C3557;">
          Website plans and SEO packages for small businesses. No upfront cost.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4a6070;">
          Every plan includes a professionally built website, Google tracking, and a content editor so you can make changes yourself. You pay monthly. Nothing until it's live. Pick the plan that matches where you are right now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">

        <!-- Plan 1: Get started -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col" style="border-color:#e5e7eb;">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-1" style="color:#1C3557;">Get started</h3>
          <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold" style="font-size:2rem; line-height:1; color:#1C3557;">£49</span>
            <span class="text-xs pb-1.5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-1" style="color:#2ECC9A;">No upfront cost</p>
          <p class="text-xs mb-5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">6 month minimum</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6">
            {[
              'Professional website built for you',
              'Shows up on Google from day one',
              'Edit your own content anytime',
              'I handle all the technical stuff',
              'One update a month included',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="block text-center text-sm font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#1C3557;">
            Get started →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Plan 2: Grow on Google (featured) -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col relative" style="background:#0D2240;">
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap" style="background:#2ECC9A; color:#0D2240;">Most popular</div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-1" style="color:#fff;">Grow on Google</h3>
          <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold" style="font-size:2rem; line-height:1; color:#fff;">£99</span>
            <span class="text-xs pb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-1" style="color:#2ECC9A;">No upfront cost</p>
          <p class="text-xs mb-5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">6 month minimum</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6">
            {[
              'Everything in Get started',
              'Blog article written every month',
              'Monthly report on visitors and sources',
              'Google listing kept up to date',
              'Up to 3 updates a month',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.2); color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="block text-center text-sm font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors" style="background:#2ECC9A; color:#0D2240;">
            Get started →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Plan 3: Fully handed off -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col" style="border-color:#e5e7eb;">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-1" style="color:#1C3557;">Fully handed off</h3>
          <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold" style="font-size:2rem; line-height:1; color:#1C3557;">£149</span>
            <span class="text-xs pb-1.5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-1" style="color:#2ECC9A;">No upfront cost</p>
          <p class="text-xs mb-5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">6 month minimum</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6">
            {[
              'Everything in Grow on Google',
              'Unlimited updates, same day',
              'Monthly catch-up call',
              'Smart tools set up to save you time',
              'Priority response',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="block text-center text-sm font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#1C3557;">
            Get started →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Plan 4: I'll manage it myself -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col" style="border-color:#e5e7eb;">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-1" style="color:#1C3557;">I'll manage it myself</h3>
          <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold" style="font-size:2rem; line-height:1; color:#1C3557;">£299</span>
            <span class="text-xs pb-1.5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">one-off</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-1" style="color:#2ECC9A;">then £15/hr</p>
          <p class="text-xs mb-5" style="color:#8a9ab0;">No monthly commitment</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6">
            {[
              'Site fully built and live',
              'Shown how to update it yourself',
              'Google tracking connected',
              'Optional £29/month hosting cover',
              'Call me anytime at £15/hr (min 1 hr)',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="block text-center text-sm font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#1C3557;">
            Get in touch →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 2: Add-ons -->
  <section class="py-16" style="background:#f2f5f7;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:#2ECC9A;">ADD-ONS</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-3xl mt-3 mb-3" style="color:#1C3557;">
          Bolt these on to any plan. At any point.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4a6070;">
          You don't have to decide now. Most clients add these in once they realise how much time they're losing to manual follow-up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

        <!-- Add-on 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#1C3557;">Never miss an enquiry</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#1C3557;">£149 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £29/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:#4a6070;">Someone contacts you, they get an instant reply, you get notified, lead is saved automatically.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Instant auto-reply on enquiry',
              'Notification to your phone',
              'Every lead saved in one place',
              '48hr follow-up reminder',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Add this on →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Add-on 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#1C3557;">Stay in touch automatically</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#1C3557;">£199 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £49/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:#4a6070;">New enquiry comes in, they get a series of helpful emails from you over the next few days. All automatic.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              '5 emails written and scheduled',
              'Sends automatically on enquiry',
              'Monthly newsletter written and sent',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Add this on →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Add-on 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#1C3557;">Know where every lead stands</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#1C3557;">£149 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £29/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:#4a6070;">All enquiries in one place. Who's interested, who you've quoted, who's gone quiet.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Simple pipeline from enquiry to won',
              'Website leads land here automatically',
              'Monthly tidy-up together',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Add this on →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Add-on 4: Best value -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-6 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full" style="background:#0D2240; color:#2ECC9A;">Best value</div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#1C3557;">The whole system connected</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#1C3557;">£399 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £79/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:#4a6070;">Enquiry in, auto-reply out, lead saved, follow-up emails sent. All automatic.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Everything above joined up',
              'Review requests sent after each job',
              'Monthly report on leads and emails',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:#4a6070;">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:#E8F5F1; color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Add this on →</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROUP 3: AI services -->
  <section class="py-16" style="background:#0D2240;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:#2ECC9A;">AI SERVICES</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-3xl mt-3 mb-3" style="color:#fff;">
          Custom AI built around your business.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">
          You don't need to understand it. Just tell me what's eating your time. Every project is scoped individually. Prices below are starting points. I'll always give you a clear quote before anything starts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

        <!-- AI 1 -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.15);">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#fff;">AI assistant for your website</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#fff;">from £499 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £49/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">A chat window on your site that answers customer questions 24/7 without you being there. Knows your services, prices, and area.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Answers FAQs instantly, any time',
              'Captures leads while you sleep',
              'Trained on your business specifically',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Get a quote →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- AI 2 -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.15);">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#fff;">Make your data flow automatically</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#fff;">from £299 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £29/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Stop copying things between apps. Enquiries, bookings, invoices, emails all connected up.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Apps connected and talking to each other',
              'No more copy-pasting between systems',
              'Saves hours every week',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Get a quote →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- AI 3 -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.15);">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#fff;">An AI that does tasks for you</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#fff;">from £599 setup</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">+ £59/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">A custom AI that handles repetitive jobs: writing quotes, summarising enquiries, drafting replies, generating reports. Built around how you work.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'Handles repetitive tasks automatically',
              'Built for your workflow',
              'Gets smarter the more you use it',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Get a quote →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- AI 4 -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(46,204,154,0.15);">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color:#fff;">Connect AI to your existing software</h3>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg" style="color:#fff;">from £799 setup</span>
            <span class="text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">quoted per project</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Already using a CRM, booking system, or app you love? I plug AI directly into it.</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 flex-1 mb-5">
            {[
              'AI built into your existing tools',
              'No need to change how you work',
              'Scoped and priced to your needs',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" style="background:rgba(46,204,154,0.15); color:#2ECC9A; font-size:9px;">✓</span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/about#contact" class="text-xs font-semibold" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Get a quote →</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQs -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

      <h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-2xl mb-8" style="color:#1C3557;">Questions people usually ask first.</h2>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        {[
          {
            q: "Do I pay anything upfront on the monthly plans?",
            a: "No. I build your site and you start paying monthly once it's live. Nothing until you're happy."
          },
          {
            q: "What happens after 6 months?",
            a: "It rolls to monthly. Cancel anytime with 30 days' notice. Most clients stay because it's working."
          },
          {
            q: "Can I add the AI stuff to my existing website?",
            a: "Yes. The AI services work on any website, not just ones I've built. Get in touch and I'll talk it through with you."
          },
          {
            q: "I don't really understand AI. Is it still worth it?",
            a: "That's exactly why I'm here. You don't need to understand it. You just tell me what's taking up your time and I'll show you what's possible."
          },
          {
            q: "How much does the AI work actually cost?",
            a: "It depends on what you need. The prices shown are starting points. I'll always give you a clear quote before any work starts. No surprises."
          },
        ].map(faq => (
          <details class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm" style="color:#1C3557; list-style:none;">
              {faq.q}
              <svg class="flex-shrink-0 faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2ECC9A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4a6070;">{faq.a}</div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16" style="background:#E8F5F1;">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-4" style="color:#1C3557;">
        Not sure which plan is right for you?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm mb-2" style="color:#4a6070;">
        Too much choice is its own problem. Most people spend longer on this page than they need to.
      </p>
